stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created: cliente confirma
    created --> awaiting_payment: se genera el pago
    awaiting_payment --> paid: webhook pago aprobado
    awaiting_payment --> expired: 15 min sin pago
    paid --> sending: se envía al proveedor
    sending --> completed: folio del proveedor
    sending --> failed: rechazo del proveedor
    sending --> sending: sin respuesta (conciliación cada 5 min)
    failed --> refunded: reembolso automático
    failed --> sending: reintento manual (si no se aplicó)
    completed --> [*]
    refunded --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
